igi\tal controllers on finite bit computer; to bring out the problems associated with digital trollers. In view of extensive use of MATLAB for rapid verification of controller designs; some notes for using MATLAB script M-files and function M-files are includ\ed at the end of the book.)/Producer(Acrobat Distiller 5.0 \(Windows\))/ModDate(D:20081211191353-05'00')/Title(Introduction to Control Engineering - Modeling, Analysis and Design)>>endobjxref
